1 REM FBCS SEG-0630
2 REM CLAIM A-4.4.2-TR164
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 4.4.2 l.1468-1470: control, a detached-handler of the main and an external SUB with the same name
5 REM are in different program-units.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
20 WHEN EXCEPTION USE Q
30 CAUSE EXCEPTION 1
40 END WHEN
50 CALL E
60 HANDLER Q
70 PRINT "H"
80 END HANDLER
90 END
100 EXTERNAL SUB E
110 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB Q
120 CALL Q
130 END SUB
200 EXTERNAL SUB Q
210 PRINT "EXT"
220 END SUB
